# Excluded from the Cloudflare Worker's asset upload (Workers caps a single
# asset at 25 MiB, and these run to ~128 MiB).
#
# public/media/ holds the large, local-only screen videos used for on-device
# testing; they are gitignored and the deployed build serves the real content
# from remote hosting instead. The small offline test clip lives in
# src/content/ and is bundled, so it is unaffected.
media/
